01:54:59.510 --> 01:55:02.722
STORIES DRAWN FROM HISTORY, FOLKLORE, ROMANCE AND EVERYDAY

01:55:02.722 --> 01:55:06.322
LIFE. ALTHOUGH IT ORIGINATED IN THE

01:55:06.793 --> 01:55:09.862
CANTONESE SPEAKING REGIONS OF SOUTHERN CHINA, IT HAS SINCE

01:55:09.862 --> 01:55:11.197
SPREAD AROUND THE WORLD AS CHINESE IMMIGRANTS BROUGHT

01:55:11.197 --> 01:55:14.000
SONGS PERFORMANCES AND STORIES ABROAD WITH THEM.

01:55:14.000 --> 01:55:17.603
THE FIRST KNOWN PERFORMANCE OF CANTONESE OPERA IN AMERICA

01:55:17.603 --> 01:55:21.340
ACTUALLY OCCURRED IN SAN FRANCISCO WHEN THE HONG TONG

01:55:21.340 --> 01:55:25.426
