01:55:25.426 --> 01:55:29.260
IN 1852. IN RECOGNITION OF ITS CULTURAL

01:55:29.497 --> 01:55:33.568
SIGNIFICANCE, CANTONESE OPERA WAS INSCRIBED IN UNESCO'S

01:55:33.568 --> 01:55:36.837
