01:55:40.442 --> 01:55:43.845
AND POPULARITY WITHIN THE CHINESE COMMUNITY, HOWEVER,

01:55:43.845 --> 01:55:47.248
OPPORTUNITIES TO EXPERIENCE AND LEARN ABOUT CANTONESE OPERA

01:55:47.248 --> 01:55:48.183
ARE LIMITED IN THE UNITED STATES.

01:55:48.183 --> 01:55:51.319
SINCE ITS FOUNDING IN 1997 BEING ONE OF THE FEW

01:55:51.319 --> 01:55:54.319
